From d7e37f68f9cbc28a48be83df08c6037f19db86cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vauzi-17 <189964753+Vauzi-17@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:04:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ntsync: Report userspace ntsync failures.

wineserver says once when it cannot create userspace ntsync objects (the
shared table is full or the region is unusable), and a userspace wait
that fails for another reason than a timeout or an abandoned mutex is
logged with its error. Both used to fail silently: object creation
failed with STATUS_TOO_MANY_OPENED_FILES and a wait returned an error
the application rarely checks.
